/libdata/firmware/if_bwfm:
ln -s brcmfmac43455-sdio.raspberrypi,4-model-b.txt "brcmfmac43455-sdio.Raspberry Pi 4 Model B.txt"
to avoid
bwfm0: autoconfiguration error: NVRAM file not available
 
